[translate: format@LRCN Trans]
[lang:en-US]
[16.628,L1]My wish remained the same, hidden in my left hand
[22.528,L2]I was dreaming a never-ending dream
[27.728,L3]An empty memory in my right hand, at the end of the unknown world
[33.806,L4]I was standing in the ceaseless rain
[40.436,L5]The strength to protect what I want to protect
[45.858,L6]The weakness of no longer believing in it
[50.300,L7]Accepting them all, search for tomorrow
[55.521,L8]Brave shine, if I reach out, yet
[1:00.876,L9]Stay the night, the night full of wounds
[1:06.326,L10]You save my life, the feelings repeated, reaching beyond the blade I held up
[1:15.867,L11]A prayer travels through time
[1:29.506,L13]A blue star that forgot how to shine
[1:35.497,L14]I was watching an unfading shadow of it
[1:40.701,L15]Red orbits passing each other, as an ignorant child
[1:46.882,L16]I was wandering in the endless night
[1:53.175,L17]The weakness of losing what can't be lost
[1:58.845,L18]The vulnerability of no longer believing in anything
[2:03.268,L19]Even if I can't stand up, destiny moves forward
[2:08.543,L20]Break down, constellations are crumbling and damaging one another in the night
[2:19.146,L21]You're breaking dawn, in the exchanged words
[2:25.948,L22]Adding a certain dream that supported my loneliness
[2:55.052,L23]If I can protect what I want to protect
[2:59.479,L24]Accept everything and search for tomorrow
[3:04.906,L25]Light up the dawn
[3:07.514,L26]Brave shine, if I reach out, yet
[3:12.938,L27]Stay the night, the night full of wounds
[3:18.146,L28]You save my life, I found a light at the end of my tears
[3:27.683,L29]A prayer travels through time

[translate: format@LRCN Trans]
[lang:zh-CN]
[16.628,L1]藏在左手的愿望 始终只是愿望
[22.528,L2]我梦见一场不会醒来的幻梦
[27.728,L3]右手握着空白的记忆 无人知晓的世界尽头
[33.806,L4]被不肯停歇的雨拍打
[40.436,L5]守护想守护之物的坚强
[45.858,L6]无法相信这份坚强的软弱
[50.300,L7]接受一切 去寻找明天
[55.521,L8]勇敢之光 只要伸出手仍能触及
[1:00.876,L9]留下来吧 在这遍体鳞伤的夜里
[1:06.326,L10]你拯救我生命 把思念交叠在举起的刃尖
[1:15.867,L11]祈愿穿越时间
[1:23.443,L12]你的勇敢之光
[1:29.506,L13]忘了如何发光的蔚蓝星球 留下了
[1:35.497,L14]望着那不会消失的影子
[1:40.701,L15]擦肩而过的红色轨迹 仍是懵懂无知的孩子
[1:46.882,L16]在不会天明的夜里彷徨
[1:53.175,L17]失去不可失去之物的软弱
[1:58.845,L18]变得什么都无法相信的脆弱
[2:03.268,L19]哪怕再也站不起来 命运仍会前进
[2:08.543,L20]崩溃坠落的星座 在互相伤害的夜里
[2:19.146,L21]你正划破黎明 在交换过的誓言里
[2:25.948,L22]连同支撑孤独的坚定梦想一并寄托
[2:55.052,L23]若真能守护想守护的一切
[2:59.479,L24]接受一切 去寻找明天
[3:04.906,L25]点亮黎明
[3:07.514,L26]勇敢之光 只要伸出手仍能触及
[3:12.938,L27]留下来吧 在这遍体鳞伤的夜里
[3:18.146,L28]你拯救我生命 在重叠泪水的尽头找到光
[3:27.683,L29]祈愿穿越时间
[3:35.537,L30]我的勇敢之光

